    <string name="host_tmux_install">Install it with the package manager, then tap Refresh:\nDebian/Ubuntu: sudo apt install tmux\nFedora: sudo dnf install tmux\nArch: sudo pacman -S tmux\nmacOS: brew install tmux</string>
